 "title": "New Job &amp; Family Services Director Announced - Delaware County",
 "text": "New Job & Family Services Director Announced - Delaware County\nSkip to main content Enable accessibility for low vision Open the accessibility menu\nToggle navigation\nSite Home\nLinkedIn\nInstagram\nFacebook\nTwitter\nContact Us\nI WANT TO\nFIND RESOURCES\nContact\nGOVERNMENT\nDELAWARE COUNTY HOME\nOFFICES & AGENCIES\nCITIES, VILLAGES & TOWNSHIPS\nResidents\nBUSINESS\nVISITORS\nSearch Site\nNew Job & Family Services Director Announced\nJane Hawes\nDirector of Communications\n(740) 833-2109\nEmail Author\nThe Delaware County Commissioners today announced a new director for their Job & Family Services Department. Jeffrey Sell, who has been with Delaware County JFS since 2020, has been hired, filling the vacancy left in August when previous director Bob Anderson left to head Hamilton County Job & Family Services.\nSell previously worked for Seneca County JFS for 21 years. A graduate of Bowling Green State University, he has served as Delaware County’s Protective Services Program Administrator and as Interim Director since Anderson’s departure.\n“We are pleased to have found the right leader for our JFS team right here within our organization,” said Jeff Benton, president of this year’s Board of Commissioners. “We are confident that Jeff Sell, who has been an integral part of this team’s excellence, will continue the record of outstanding service that has been established.”\nWith more than 70 employees, Delaware County JFS serves a wide variety of constituents in one of the fastest growing counties in Ohio. Whether facing challenges with monthly living expenses, healthcare, raising a family, enhancing job skills, or seeking employment, county residents can find the help they need accessing financial and practical resources from federal, state and local government. For more information about Delaware County JFS, visit their website at: https://jfs.co.delaware.oh.us/ .\nContact Information\nHistoric Courthouse\n91 North Sandusky Street\nDelaware, Ohio 43015\nMap It\nPhone: (740) 833-2000\nFax: (740) 833-2099\nSite Navigation\nHome\nFind Resources\nGovernment\nResidents\nBusiness\nVisitors\nQuick Links\nProperty Search\nCounty Government Calendar\nMedia Room\nPublic Notices and Bids\nPublic Records Requests\nUnclaimed Funds Page\nHuman Resources\nSign Up for Delco Alerts\nGovDeals Auction\nBoards & Commissions\nDirectory\nSocial Media\nLinkedIn\nInstagram\nFacebook\nTwitter\n© Delaware County Ohio. All Rights Reserved. Please review our Privacy Policy .\nAdmin Login",
